      "summary": "Email received:<p>Hey $name,<p>Wanted to invite you to the Hanzo beta — we&#x27;re looking for top open-source devs to help us shape the future of agentic AI.<p>Join the beta: https:&#x2F;&#x2F;hanzo[.]app&#x2F;beta<p>I was checking out your open-source work on s3tools&#x2F;s3cmd (especially what you&#x27;ve been building with Open-Source AI &#x2F; ML) — really impressive engineering. We&#x27;ve been exploring autonomous decision systems and tool-use agents and would love your input.<p>Let me know if you&#x27;d like to hop on a quick call, we&#x27;re trying to speak with as many builders as we can: https:&#x2F;&#x2F;cal[.]com&#x2F;antje-worring<p>Warmly,\nAntje Worring\nCo-CEO, Hanzo AI<p>GitHub: https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github[.]com&#x2F;zooqueen<p>LinkedIn: https:&#x2F;&#x2F;www.linkedin[.]com&#x2F;in&#x2F;antje-worring&#x2F;<p>Hanzo AI, Inc. · 1 Ferry Building, Suite 201, San Francisco, CA 94111\nUnsubscribe: https:&#x2F;&#x2F;hanzo[.]app&#x2F;unsubscribe\nReply &#x27;stop&#x27; to opt out<p>(I have not participated in the repo in question in over a decade)",
